  "faqQuestion2": "When are the keys going to be updated?",
  "@faqQuestion2": {
    "description": "Used on faq page"
  },
  "faqQuestion3": "What's the difference between encrypted and decrypted?",
  "@faqQuestion3": {
    "description": "Used on faq page"
  },
  "faqQuestion4": "Where can I find the downloaded packs?",
  "@faqQuestion4": {
    "description": "Used on faq page"
  },
  "faqQuestion5": "What is keys.tsv?",
  "@faqQuestion5": {
    "description": "Used on faq page"
  },
  "faqQuestion6": "How can i use Persona items?",
  "@faqQuestion6": {
    "description": "Used on faq page"
  },
  "faqQuestion7": "Why do some skin packs appear broken?",
  "@faqQuestion7": {
    "description": "Used on faq page"
  },
  "faqQuestion8": "What's the purpose of the \"Account Login\" page?",
  "@faqQuestion8": {
    "description": "Used on faq page"
  },
  "faqQuestion9": "What does the checkmark mean?",
  "@faqQuestion9": {
    "description": "Used on faq page"
  },
  "faqAnswer1": "The process of obtaining the keys is not magic: a person still has to buy the pack and share the keys with us. Without somebody buying it there would be no decryption keys in the first place. It is not possible to obtain them in any other way. Wait patiently or buy it.",
  "@faqAnswer1": {
    "description": "Answer for FAQ question 1"
  },
  "faqAnswer2": "Once we decide to.",
  "@faqAnswer2": {
    "description": "Answer for FAQ question 2"
  },
  "faqAnswer3": "Encrypted means turning the file into scrambled words that look like gibberish. No one can read it without a special key. Encrypted Minecraft contents are unplayable.\n\nDecrypted means using the special key to turn the gibberish back into the original content. Now the Minecraft contents can be used.",
  "@faqAnswer3": {
    "description": "Answer for FAQ question 3"
  },
  "faqAnswer4": "You can find the packs here Download/Rin23",
  "@faqAnswer4": {
    "description": "Answer for FAQ question 4"
  },
  "faqAnswer5": "It's a file that stores the pack UUID's with their respective decryption keys. Without the decryption keys downloaded packs would be unplayable.",
  "@faqAnswer5": {
    "description": "Answer for FAQ question 5"
  },
  "faqAnswer6": "U can't. They do exist some methods but given the complexity to be done, it is not feasible.",
  "@faqAnswer6": {
    "description": "Answer for FAQ question 6"
  },
  "faqAnswer7": "Some skin packs (especially franchise collabs) use custom geometry which Minecraft doesn't allow to be used normally unless u buy the skin pack. U can check if a skin pack uses custom geometry by checking if the file \"geometry.json\" exists in the pack. Keep in mind that this issue is not related to the tool in any way.",
  "@faqAnswer7": {
    "description": "Answer for FAQ question 7"
  },
  "faqAnswer8": "The account login page allows you to authenticate with your Microsoft account to directly load your Minecraft keys from your inventory.\nThis is useful when Rin23 doesn’t currently have a key available for a specific DLC but you do have it in your account, once your keys are loaded that DLC will appear available for download. \nNote that the keys are automatically uploaded to our database, where they will later be merged with Rin23’s main key database so everyone can enjoy the new dlc, so please use this feature if u wanna contribute.",
  "@faqAnswer8": {
    "description": "Answer for FAQ question 8"
  },
  "faqAnswer9Checkmark": "The key for this DLC is available.",
  "@faqAnswer9Checkmark": {
    "description": "Answer for FAQ question 9. checkmark ok"
  },
  "faqAnswer9NoCheckmark": "The app currently does not have the key for this DLC.",
  "@faqAnswer9NoCheckmark": {
    "description": "Answer for FAQ question 9. no checkmark"
  },
  "faqAnswer9ExtraInfo": "Keys are required to unlock the DLCs.",
  "@faqAnswer9ExtraInfo": {
    "description": "Extra information for FAQ question 9"
  },
  "faqQuestionDownload": "Why is the download button unavailable?",
  "@faqQuestionDownload": {
    "description": "Used on the item detail page"
  },
  "faqAnswerDownload": "The key to unlock this dlc is not available, wait patiently or buy it.",
  "@faqAnswerDownload": {
    "description": "Answer for faq download item detail page"
  },
  "faqQuestionKey": "How do i get the key?",
  "@faqQuestionKey": {
    "description": "used on the item detail page"
  },
  "faqAnswerKey": "Buy the dlc on your account then go to settings > Account login > Click 'Start authentication' > click 'Load keys', now click 'Share' and share the keys files to the Bluecoin chat, the keys are going to be added to the app database. if u can't share the keys file to the group, don't worry, the keys get automatically uploaded to a database.",
  "@faqAnswerKey": {
    "description": "Answer for faq key item detail page"
  },
